<title>NEW ZEALAND: Radio Otago buys all shares in C93FM Chch.</title>
<headline>Radio Otago buys all shares in C93FM Chch.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Radio Otago said on Thursday it has purchased all of the shares in Christchurch radio station C93FM Ltd for NZ$3.5 million in cash.</p>
<p>C93 operates C93FM and 194.5FM in Christchurch.</p>
<p>Radio Otago said the contract was unconditional.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
